[BODY] the admin archive carries withPrices true for the sampled order and its total equals the privileged live read - an export runs on a background worker, so this is the check that the worker acts with the rights of the user who STARTED it rather than with no user at all {SPEC}
[BODY] the price-blind user archive carries withPrices false and total 0 for that same order {SPEC}
[REL] admin_archive.total == privileged.total and != 0, AND denied_archive.total == 0 - the two archives DIVERGE on one order. Two archives that agree mean the acting identity never reached the protection service, whichever way they agree {SPEC}
